# Project Stack - Frontend: React (or vanilla JS) - Backend: Node.js, Express - Database: MongoDB # Conventions - Use Conventional Commits (feat:, fix:, docs:, chore:) - Component files in PascalCase - Keep functions small and single-purpose - Write clear commit messages # Learned from FE-03 workflow drill - Never use useEffect to sync form state from initial values; use defaultValues instead - Every form field needs a visible label + aria-describedby on errors - New components must be explicitly wired into App.jsx, not just created
